{
  "id": "2SA.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "2SA",
  "reference": "2 Tham 10",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2SA 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Juc Dee-bid kɛ ji̱ Am-on kɛnɛ ji̱ Thi-ri-ya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr kä mi mi cu kuäär ji̱ Am-on li̱w, kä cu gatdɛ ni Ɣa-nun ruëc kɛ gua̱thdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dee-bid wee i̱, “Ɣän bä lät agɔaa kɛ Ɣa-nun gat Na-ɣac, kɛ ɣöö ci gua̱n lät agɔaa kɛ ɣä.” Cu Dee-bid naath ja̱k lätdɛ jɛ tɛ̈th lɔacdɛ kɛ kui̱ gua̱n. Kä cu ja̱a̱ŋ Dee-bid ben muun ji̱ Am-on. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu bööth ji̱ Am-on Ɣa-nun kuääriɛn jiök i̱, “Diiwi jɛ ɛn ɣöö Dee-bid, jäkɛ ni ji̱ kä tɛ̈th lɔacdɛ kɛ kui̱ guur? Jäkɛ ni kuaanykɛ, kɛ ɣöö ba wec ben lim, kä ba cu ben ka̱n?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu Ɣa-nun kuaany Dee-bid ti̱kkiɛn mut kui̱ kɛl, kä cuɛ bieynikiɛn rɛ̈t dääriɛn kɛnɛ jolkiɛn, kä cuɛ kɛ jak kä wä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ca la̱r Dee-bid, cuɛ kɛ jäk kä nɛy ti luɔrkɛ kɛ, kɛ ɣöö cikɛ pöc ɛlɔ̱ŋ kɛn naath. Kä cu kuäär wee i̱, “Ta̱yɛ kä Jɛ-ri-ko amäni mi ci ti̱kkun do̱ny, bia ku lɛ ben.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci ji̱ Am-on ɛ nɛn ɛn ɣöö ci ka ji̱ tɛ̈r Dee-bid, cukɛ nɛy ti bathdɔɔri ti jiɛɛn rɛw kɔk kä ji̱ Thi-ri-ya tin te kä Beth-re-ɣob kɛnɛ tin te kä Dho-baa, kɛ ji̱ Tob ti bathdɔɔri wäl rɛw. Kɛ kuäär Maakaa kɛnɛ nɛy ti bathdɔɔr kɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Dee-bid ɛ liŋ, cuɛ Yo-ab ja̱k kɛnɛ ji̱ ko̱o̱r diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Am-on ben raar cua tuɔ̱ŋ ben car thok duɔ̱p wec. Kä cu ji̱ Thi-ri-ya tin te kä Dho-baa, kɛnɛ Rɛ-ɣob, kɛ ji̱ Tob kɛ Maakaa, cuɔ̱ŋ kä rɔ̱ kueer wec.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Yo-ab ɛ nɛn ɛn ɣöö ba kɛ ma̱k kɛ nhiam kɛnɛ jɔk, cuɛ naath kuany kä ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kä cuɛ kɛ la̱th lotdä ji̱ Thi-ri-ya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ duɔth nath ka̱m däman ni Ä-bi-cay, kä cua rɔ̱ car lotdä ji̱ Am-on. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Mi wä ji̱ Thi-ri-ya ɣä wä tiam lua̱kɛ ɣä. Kä mi wa yɛ wä tiam ɛ ji̱ Am-on, bä yɛ ben luäk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɔmɛ rɔ̱ agɔaa, kä buɔ̱mnɛ rɔ̱ kɛ kui̱ nɛɛni kɔn, kɛnɛ kui̱ wec Kuɔthdan. Kä bi Kuoth Nhial la̱t ni min gɔaa kɛ jɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu Yo-ab kɛnɛ nɛɛkɛ wä nyiëëny kɛ ji̱ Thi-ri-ya. Kä cukɛ rɔ̱ bar kɛ Yo-ab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci ji̱ Am-on ɛ nɛn ɛn ɣöö ci ji̱ Thi-ri-ya rɔ̱ bar, cukɛ rɔ̱ bar bäkɛ Ä-bi-cay, cukɛ riŋ rɛy wec. Kä cu Yo-ab luny jɔk ko̱o̱r kɛ ji̱ Am-on, kä cuɛ ben kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci ji̱ Thi-ri-ya jɛ nɛn i̱ ca kɛ joc ɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, cukɛ rɔ ma̱a̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Ɣä-dɛ̈d-ɛdhɛr raan ja̱k, wëë ji̱ Thi-ri-ya tin te jɔk kiɛɛr Yu-pɛ-ree-tidh nööŋ. Kä cukɛ ben kä Ɣe-lam, kɛɛl kɛ Co-bɛ̈k bo̱o̱th rɛ̈m Ɣä-dɛ̈d-ɛdhɛr bo̱thɛ kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ca la̱r Dee-bid, cuɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal ma̱a̱t, kä cuɛ jiɛth kui̱ Jɔr-dɛn, kä cuɛ ben kä Ɣe-lam. Kä cu ji̱ Thi-ri-ya nyiëëny kɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Thi-ri-ya rɔ bar kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl. Kä cu Dee-bid kɛ näk ji̱ Thurbiɛɛli ti kur bärɔw, kɛ ji̱ jiöŋkööri ti bathdɔɔri ti jiɛɛn ŋuaan, kä cua Co-bɛ̈k bo̱o̱th rɛ̈mdiɛn moc buɔ̱t, kä cuɛ li̱w ɛn wa̱nɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci kua̱r kɔar Ɣä-dɛ̈d-ɛdhɛr diaal ɛ nɛn ɛn ɣöö ca kɛ joc ɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, cukɛ mal lat kɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kä cu ka ja̱a̱ŋ I-thɛ-rɛl. Inɔ cu ji̱ Thi-ri-ya dual kɛ ɣöö ba ji̱ Am-on nyɔk kɛ luäk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
